  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nepal Food, Health and Nutrition Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Following our highly successful food, health and nutrition initiative in Nepal during the earthquake of 2015 and with overwhelming request from local leaders and organizations we are launching a similar project focusing on the same thematic areas with the main aim of improving the lives of poor villagers. We will target 1,000 poor households in the provision of food and farming inputs, technical knowledge and nutrition improvement capabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
